# HYPERFOCUSzone AI Platform

## Overview

HYPERFOCUSzone is a next-gen social ecosystem built from the Uhive blueprint and optimized for neurodivergent brilliance. We combine mobile-first exploration, dual “worlds,” blockchain rewards, VR integration, and dopamine-rich gamification loops. Our mission is to empower ADHD and dyslexic minds through modular AI agents, squad synergy roles, and emotion-adaptive feedback. This README guides our AI team through architecture, workflows, and contribution practices.

---

## Core Features

- Dual Worlds
  - Civilized World (identified profiles)
  - Free World (anonymous exploration)

- Exploration Interface
  - Pinch-zoom and swipe navigation
  - Custom “spaces” by interest category

- Token & Rewards
  - On-chain HYPE token
  - Engagement-driven tokenomics and badges

- VR & Immersive Modules
  - WebXR viewer embedded in mobile app
  - Optional first-person exploration mode

- Gamification Engine
  - Points, levels, milestone celebrations
  - Dopamine-triggered micro-rituals

---

## Architecture Overview

| Layer                  | Technology                          | Purpose                                                    |
|------------------------|-------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| Front-End              | React Native                        | Mobile UI with smooth gesture handling                    |
| Back-End               | Node.js + Fastify                   | High-throughput API, modular service architecture          |
| Real-Time Messaging    | Socket.IO                           | Instant posts, comments, notifications                     |
| Database               | PostgreSQL + Redis                  | ACID user data, in-memory session state                    |
| Blockchain Integration | Ethereum L2 / Polygon               | Smart contracts for HYPE token issuance and rewards        |
| VR Module              | Unity + Three.js / WebXR            | Embeddable immersive scenes                                |
| AI Agents & Moderation | Python + LangChain                  | Squad-based content tagging, emotion analysis, feed curation|

