## Getting Started

1. Clone the repository
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-org/HYPERFOCUSzone.git
   cd HYPERFOCUSzone
   ```

2. Install dependencies
   ```bash
   npm install       # backend + frontend
   pip install -r ai/requirements.txt
   ```

3. Environment setup
   - Copy `.env.example` to `.env`
   - Populate keys: POSTGRES_URL, JWT_SECRET, ETH_RPC_URL

4. Launch services
   ```bash
   npm run dev       # starts API and mobile bundler
   npm run ai:start  # boots AI agent pods locally
   ```

