## AI Team Guidelines

Our AI squad powers everything from content curation to emotion-adaptive UX. Follow these principles:

- Modular Agents
  - Each agent has a single responsibility (e.g., sentiment tagging, spam detection).
  - Agents communicate via message bus patterns.

- Dopamine-Driven Feedback
  - Short-lived micro-completion signals after each agent task.
  - Celebrate in logs with emoji or console colors.

- Neurodivergent-First Design
  - Prioritize clarity and minimal cognitive load in prompts.
  - Provide fallback behaviors for high-latency or failed responses.

- Collaboration & Review
  - Use pull requests with AI-specific labels (`ai/agent`, `ai/prompt`).
  - Include performance benchmarks (latency, accuracy) in PR descriptions.

