## Contribution Guide

- Branching Model
  1. `main` – stable release
  2. `develop` – latest integrated features
  3. `feature/your-feature` – work in progress

- Code Style
  - JavaScript / TypeScript: Prettier + ESLint
  - Python: Black + Flake8

- Commit Messages
  - Use Conventional Commits: `feat(ai): add new emotion agent`
  - Reference related issues (e.g., `#42`)

- Testing
  - Unit tests for each agent (`pytest` for Python, Jest for JS)
  - End-to-end smoke tests for exploration flows

